meshopt_decoder.module.js: the meshoptimizer decoder (meshoptimizer 1.1), byte-identical to the copy three.js 0.186.0
ships in examples/jsm/libs/ (research/gf-three/tools/lib/vendor/three, from the npm tarball). Used by gf/forge/meshopt.js
to decode EXT_meshopt_compression before the core reads a GLB.

